  </select>
</label>
<label>Grid samples per side: <output id="gridDensityVal">25</output>
  <input id="gridDensityInput" type="range" min="6" max="45" step="1" value="25"
         oninput="document.getElementById('gridDensityVal').value=this.value;update_gridDensity(+this.value)">
</label>
<span style="font-size:11px;color:#555;line-height:1.4">Hover the figure: the arrow under the cursor is split into its <b style="color:#c0392b">away&nbsp;from&nbsp;+q</b> and <b style="color:#2471c9">toward&nbsp;&minus;q</b> parts. Click for the numbers.</span>
<span style="border-top:1px solid #dcdfe3;margin:4px 0 2px 0"></span>
